<title>USA: Blonder Tongue sued by Scientific-Atlanta.</title>
<headline>Blonder Tongue sued by Scientific-Atlanta.</headline>
<dateline>OLD BRIDGE, N.J. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blonder Tongue Laboratories Inc said late Friday after the market closed that it has been served with a complaint by Scientific-Atlanta Inc, alleging patent infringement.</p>
<p>Blonder said the suit relates to the company's VideoMask signal interdiction product.</p>
<p>The company said its outside patent counsel has advised the company that it should expect no liability to result from the suit.</p>
</text>
